    "DROP-IN FOLDER — this is the only place you touch when worksheets change.",
    "1. Put the worksheet PDF in this folder, filename exactly as listed in 'file' below.",
    "2. Put the answer-key PDF in here too (filename in 'answerFile').",
    "3. To ADD a worksheet: copy any block below, change the fields, drop the PDF in.",
    "4. To REPLACE a worksheet (new year's paper): overwrite the PDF with the same filename.",
    "   Nothing else changes — the app re-renders the new pages automatically.",
    "5. To RETIRE one: set \"archived\": true. It leaves the dropdown but keeps old class scores.",
    "The app renders these PDFs page by page, so diagrams, tables and figures appear exactly as printed."
